## Summary

Shows a short quote of the day at the top of the home view.

## What it does

A small card on the home view shows one quote from a list of twenty built-in quotes, picked by the date. The user can hide the card.

## Seed prompt

Add a new file with twenty short public-domain quotes and a small card component that picks one by the day of the year. Register the card on the home view, with a hide button that remembers the choice in local storage.

## Acceptance checks

1. The home view shows a quote card.
2. The quote changes from one day to the next.
3. Hiding the card keeps it hidden after a restart.
